$COMMENT  This file is an empty form that can be used to create a "Info" file for  a program by inserting appropriate text between the keyword lines below.  This template lists all possible keywords. Altough it is recommended to  supply information for as many keywords as possible, all keyword lines  marked "optional" can be omitted from an info file. If you are not yet  familiar with the "Info" file concept, please have a look at existing  info files before filling in this form, in order to get an idea of what  sort of information we expect for the various keywords.$PROGRAM-NAME  Name of the program (FIRST KEYWORD, <=20 chars, mandatory) etags$PURPOSE  What is the program/package for ? (<=50 chars, mandatory) Tag file generator$SUMMARY  Short summary. (<=3 lines of <=80 chars each, mandatory) ETAGS generates tag files used by editors like VI or GNU-Emacs ctags style tag files may be generated. ETAGS knows the syntax of C, Fortran,  LaTex, Scheme and Emacs Lisp/Common Lisp$KEYWORDS  Keywords for database, comma separated (<20 chars each, recommended) etags, ctags, tag files, editor$STATUS  Program status (final, beta, experimental etc) (no limit, optional) final$SCREEN-INTERFACE  Termcap, Zterm, etc. (<40 chars, mandatory if not raw-I/O) non$DOCUMENTATION  Type and language of documentation (<80 chars, mandatory) -? option, no doc file available$SOURCE-LANGUAGE  Programming Language(s) used (<30 chars, mandatory) C$SOURCE-AVAILABILITY  Avaliability of source code (<30 chars, mandatory) full source available$COMPILATION  How to compile the program (no limit, optional) makefile$AUTHOR-NAME  Name(s) ONLY of the author(s). (<=80 chars, mandatory) GNU (part of GNU Emacs)$AUTHOR-INFO  Additional information about the author(s) (no limit, optional) adapted to OSK by Hubert Nehring Dahlemer Strasse 4 D-5090 Leverkusen 1 member of EFFO$AVAILABILITY  Public, Shareware, Commercial ? (<=30 chars, mandatory) Public$DISTRIBUTOR  Where can the program be obtained from ? (<=80 chars, mandatory) EFFO Forum ?????